{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "8eb8f224249cd223ad107b94d05e2b62d9cc4891d33fb801be21907faeeef194", "ja": "えっ……！？　め、恵美ちゃん、\nいきなり、どうしたの……？", "zh": "咦……！？惠、惠美，\n你怎么突然哭了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "a837855c7f4837f8ee97394292d69640e812bc0a8d6cb880641c8905289785ad", "ja": "可憐……まつり、エレナ！\nみんな、ホントにありがと～！！", "zh": "可怜……茉莉、艾琳娜！\n真的很谢谢大家～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "22c8878246063a67ec4d2c9b87c03cf08c0f0c9a9068b04d1466d4f5ef1178cb", "ja": "みんなのおかげで、初めてのセンター、\n無事にできたよ！　アタシ、アタシ……ぐすっ。", "zh": "都是托大家的福，我才能顺利完成第一次的\nCenter演唱会！我、我……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "caad74d59688667ad5a66e4d06085a18754d0144a041bbd887741e7aacab9254", "ja": "恵美ちゃん……えへへ。\nわ、私、役に立ったのかな？　よかった……♪", "zh": "惠美……嘿嘿。\n我、我应该有帮上一点忙吧？太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "f43c1d170bb760bfd20ff5c0ddfe4dc6b3ce8c3f124201f4524f7e2b88938b50", "ja": "当たり前だよ！　役に立ってないワケないじゃん！\nうわ～～ん！！", "zh": "当然啦！怎么可能没帮上忙！\n呜哇～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "4138e83cc078f24bc50e4cbbdde26f08f997782b721bffe4daa88fb0c62fe0a5", "ja": "あっ、ご、ごめんなさい……。そんな、泣かないで……\n恵美ちゃんに泣かれちゃうと、私まで……うぅ……。", "zh": "啊，对、对不起……怎么办，你不要哭……\n惠美你一哭，连我也……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1014_p", "source_sha256": "123268764eea8fa005cd4a32a15ca32c9eb219ca80d9857eb19bd22889091102", "ja": "（みんな、すごい喜びようだな。\nでも、気持ちはわかる……）", "zh": "（大家都喜形于色呢。\n不过，我可以理解她们的心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "bc096215bda7695d835aa5b2c7e4c10eb0deeb9a6a275f0bcd2a74f67a6ddaec", "ja": "あー、ズルイ！\nメグミとカレンだけ仲良くして！", "zh": "啊～不公平！\n只有惠美和可怜在相亲相爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "352f0f8324c16613d2f45896f79a16a6c059a7f74fc20559e193eda1318820ee", "ja": "はいほー！　みんな、姫も混ぜるのですー！", "zh": "Hi Ho──！各位，也要让公主加入唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "fc1316fc8cda1c52170f371e9699bbee0e025b9dfd5ffc6702cc4e7968f1a21a", "ja": "って、ふたりとも、なんで泣いてるノ？\nもー、泣き虫なんだカラ……ホラホラ、笑って♪", "zh": "是说你们为什么在哭啊？\n真是的，你们都是爱哭鬼呢……来来来，笑一个♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "8d30cbfb9f518f6529d4674f6afb11594ba2c702d66e15ae52bd7783fe31f759", "ja": "嬉しい時は、笑顔がイチバンだヨ～！\nネッ、{$P$}♪", "zh": "开心的时候，就要露出笑容才对唷～！\n对吧，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8a64acf3e5cff4d1c37f97fd3123a0e1b4f385061da98e5056fde6592e06bf36", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！　涙も、たまにはいいけど……\n嬉しい時は、笑顔の方がいい。", "zh": "嗯，是啊！虽然偶尔掉些眼泪也没关系……\n但开心的时候，还是露出笑容比较适合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "828af1d0eebe4b1cb8b1c36c45e042397f940dc454c4eed2eda89234e2fd0560", "ja": "えっ！？\n{$P$}、いつからいたの～！？", "zh": "咦！？\n{$P$}，你什么时候来的～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "04bb5a1749a11e819d5a14cffeb1afa0faf872e883ec234ebd2d52adfd5eb357", "ja": "きゃあっ！？\n{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "呀啊！？\n{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1022_p", "source_sha256": "61ad808c2246b73d97bdd1bf0478ed9ec0081a1e615314401ab480672ee10143", "ja": "みんな、そろそろ落ち着いたか？\nお疲れさま！　大成功だったな！", "zh": "大家稍微平静点了吗？\n辛苦你们了！表演非常成功喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "d5a9d6b66d0f2d03894defa8c2dabf715f685a3567434f9bbae1c513551d5884", "ja": "うん……。\nへへ、{$P$}も、お疲れさま！", "zh": "嗯……\n嘿嘿，{$P$}，你也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1024_p", "source_sha256": "415378e82ac3598dc2e1ca1837b7415a92d61ab0f020b6b97048ca6d848add6e", "ja": "恵美、頑張ったな。\n気持ちのこもった、いいステージだったよ。", "zh": "惠美，你很努力呢。\n这场表演非常精彩，能感受到你的真心诚意喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "2b6ab2d70bde3f2a3c389ef887cc5555b0a50f798f1ea7d6e43ce05bcabc9646", "ja": "そ、そう？　それならよかったよ。\nアタシ、結構、緊張してたからさ～。", "zh": "是、是吗？那就好。\n我啊，其实很紧张呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ce88f8419eeec9d3954a0544f571ad3b307abbcd94cf1a3bafc75e7acf960955", "ja": "そうだったか？\nあまり、そんな風には見えなかったけどな。", "zh": "会吗？\n从你的表现看不太出来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "360e8dbb1490ee8da3fc8da91d10cda7bd99d89262b724494eec3c5e506cde41", "ja": "うん！　だって、アタシには仲間がいるからね♪\nMC飛んじゃった時は、どうしようかと思ったけど…。", "zh": "嗯！因为有伙伴们陪在我身边啊♪\n主持不小心忘词的时候，我心里慌得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "3d73f679941d05cfec9d8a72f1491b2b9c56ac228f1e1e823b4701edaefa3580", "ja": "エレナとまつりが、お客さんに話しかけてくれてさ。\nアタシが落ち着くまで、可憐がそばにいてくれたんだ。", "zh": "还好有艾琳娜和茉莉代替我和观众对话。\n在我冷静下来前，可怜也都一直陪着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1029_p", "source_sha256": "37305fe4d2c5de6a133f3c0d4850ec73217bb363d056e9c481fb6c79ab6a1641", "ja": "そうか。みんなに助けてもらったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，大家帮了很多忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "5b209dfac5f9fa00b304e698ff451a07771158f37138938b73dac1f24da4ab5d", "ja": "うん！　あ、あとはね～……\n{$P$}が、見ててくれたし！", "zh": "嗯！啊，还有就是～\n有{$P$}在看着我表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "a913c6aa43fab692e0509246094d7aa0141532034e6af2b156125f653d73d814", "ja": "今日のライブが楽しかったのは、みんなのおかげ！\nみんな、ホント～にありがとね！！", "zh": "今天的演唱会能这么开心，都是多亏了大家！\n各位，真的很～谢谢你们！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "2fa90678fd9883c91ee67d01dc77fbc1e5267e5239a76f97acd80b193f9add77", "ja": "もちろん、まつり達の力もありますけど……\n一番の大きな力は、恵美ちゃんの頑張りなのですよ？", "zh": "茉莉我们当然有尽一份力没错……\n但最大的功劳，还是来自小惠美的努力唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "9766be2c0a35bd6bf20702ada0b80550b59da851a4b4fa4db48f2e8084c84bfd", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……恵美ちゃんが、頑張ったから……\n今日のライブは、最高になったんだと思うな……♪", "zh": "就、就是说啊……因为惠美很努力……\n今天的演唱会才会这么成功……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1034_p", "source_sha256": "3843e659786a1916d2218b8dd44d5fb10e1de7bddf447091f2e29b9bc31afb85", "ja": "そうだな。恵美は、今日のライブのために、\nたくさんレッスンを頑張ってきた。その結果だな。", "zh": "没错。惠美为了今天的演唱会努力做了许多练习，\n而这就是努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_012_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_012_1035_p", "source_sha256": "cb56f1391c660898ff7d0dbff6bda75c55501219e6e18c13b88e1299b84cc6d2", "ja": "エレナ達が恵美を支えてくれたのも、\n恵美が、そんな恵美だったから……かな。", "zh": "艾琳娜她们愿意帮忙惠美，\n也是因为看到了这样的惠美……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
